WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,380
It seems that the quality is average and has not changed much.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,380
Forget it, let’s look for the fuel tank first.

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:13,680
We found enough to take all the oil from the ship.

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,960
This area is a group of buildings photographed by drone

5
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,720
It turned out to be a furniture wholesale market

6
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,880
All the wood that could be burned was moved away by the survivors.

7
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,480
The rest of these can still be used

8
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,560
This is too much. I’m afraid I won’t be able to use it all in my lifetime.

9
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,880
Forget it, I gained enough today, go home

10
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,880
The Agricultural Science and Technology Park is too far away, so I won’t go there yet.

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,280
I also cut down a lot of trees today. I will make charcoal when I get home.

12
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,940
Why did things suddenly change?

13
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:45,280
It's a snow leopard

14
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,960
Fortunately, I haven't gotten off the car yet to change to skis.

15
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,800
Otherwise, I will be the one who gets smashed.

16
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,440
Although it's safe to hide in space, I can't see what's going on outside.

17
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:53,600
When you go out, it will be dangerous if the hail does not stop.

18
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,840
Put on protective gear and put a steel plate on it and go out and take a look.
